{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "049eis_403_2_4_049_03_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:527da887da705df814ff3b26dee06c82222b034889c216704ae7302f152f0275",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:049eis_403_2_4_049_03_09_a:2_4_049_03_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e78117bb4cf379d652e6ff2e191cdf46ad26a12cd48cd7c7b4c1ac146c7e712",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー。\n家里寄来了一批照片，这是你之前提到的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_403_2_4_049_03_09_a:2_4_049_03_09_a:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9304d6df730aa9403aca9a683205001b9daf7aa45f009fcf26228c682ae16d4a",
      "text": "是圣诞演出的\n照片",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_403_2_4_049_03_09_a:2_4_049_03_09_a:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2462b794498f3c6f22258441f9fc872bcc4e83fb50d55406f55f29c6e7387142",
      "text": "啊，果然如此么。\n就是那批要刊登在杂志上，希望我确认的照片吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_403_2_4_049_03_09_a:2_4_049_03_09_a:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57e4b20416da2ae457589ea01818ac8d9b7c4e56a52844a8b6dc11ae7fda976a",
      "text": "如果有在意的部分\n请随时告诉我",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_403_2_4_049_03_09_a:2_4_049_03_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:daf486a8b508dc2840e468281e9655fc12efc6fe1b993dbd1e812b0883a0be5d",
      "text": "知道了，我会过目的。\n……听说刊登这组照片的那一期，也会有关于父亲的特辑。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_403_2_4_049_03_09_a:2_4_049_03_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55e59bc18424804b72b3d63f350268601febbaca224039d187358c087d537986",
      "text": "虽说只是杂志上的报道，但我和父亲的名字将并列在一起。\n……这让我有些在意大众的反响。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_403_2_4_049_03_09_a:2_4_049_03_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6401cdb063356b16d518b87daad7f8c70798bd0e4f9c76e1bea9dd4123de55e",
      "text": "演出非常棒，\n所以完全没问题的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_403_2_4_049_03_09_a:2_4_049_03_09_a:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20c88e73b2a57b77089c7b0678f2643fc141d6d8a33394a7f4fd01d8b8454ea8",
      "text": "大家的照片是\n最为耀眼的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_403_2_4_049_03_09_a:2_4_049_03_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3034acbf011bc8630971a2bed507e6cea0f8560f71f1d34543eb6106810bcb55",
      "text": "既然你都这么说了，\n那成品想必不至于令人感到羞愧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_403_2_4_049_03_09_a:2_4_049_03_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71f044d94cab1eaac16f5f87825aa02825802919c0535087ac112b8b4df9fc14",
      "text": "是吗。……谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:049eis_403_2_4_049_03_09_a:2_4_049_03_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c53426825f8d536a5720d661dce42c2b8798007758c8876a43d33e1ce93c7b44",
      "text": "那么，等我确认完照片，会再次联系你。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
